# Headless logic tests (tools/LogicTests) — keep the project file, ignore build output
!/tools/LogicTests/LogicTests.csproj
/tools/LogicTests/bin/

# Editor/build logs written to the project root (e.g. -logFile unity_apk.log from docs/android-build.md):
# raw logs contain local machine paths and must not be committed
/*.log
